"Keberhasilan transplantasi","bola akar hasil air-pruning jauh lebih minim syok saat dipindah — krusial bagi penanam komersial."],["Drainase air","dinding berlubang cegah genangan di wilayah curah hujan tinggi (musim hujan Vietnam, Indonesia)."]],"galleryTitle":"Rentang ukuran dan aplikasi","galleryNote":"Foto ukuran dan aplikasi lainnya dikirim bersama paket sampel.","faq":[["Dinding solid atau mesh?","Kami suplai keduanya. Mesh/berlubang = air pruning. Solid = pembibitan standar. Ukuran gallon sama tersedia di kedua gaya."],["Umur UV?","PP stabil UV tahan 2-3 musim outdoor di iklim tropis."],["Bisa campur ukuran dalam satu order?","Bisa — minimum total 500 pcs, bisa dibagi sampai 4 ukuran."],["Form E RCEP tersedia?","Ya — kami penerbit Form E RCEP terdaftar. Menurunkan bea masuk ke 0-5% untuk Vietnam dan Indonesia."]],"shipping":["Bisa disusun saat kosong — 500 pcs pot 3 gal hanya sekitar 1,8 CBM (vs 4+ CBM jika tidak bisa disusun).","Rute utama: FOB Shenzhen → Cat Lai (VN) 6 hari; → Tanjung Priok (ID) 9 hari; → Laem Chabang (TH) 8 hari.","HS 3926.90 — tarif preferensi RCEP berlaku untuk VN, TH, ID, MY, SG."],"ctaPrimary":"Minta Penawaran","ctaWhatsapp":"WhatsApp Sales","moqLadder":["500-1499 pcs: ukuran dan warna standar, campur sampai 4 ukuran","1500-3999 pcs: mix rentang gallon penuh dengan marking karton","4000+ pcs: marking private label dan loading kontainer sesuai kebutuhan"],"leadTime":["Sampel: 5-8 hari untuk ukuran gallon standar","Order besar: 20-30 hari setelah DP dan penguncian jumlah","Musim puncak: cadangkan 2 minggu untuk slot logistik"]}}}')), updated_at = '2026-10-28T08:33:28.324Z' WHERE id = 'prod_gs_nursery_001';

UPDATE products SET spec_json = json_set(spec_json, '$.detail', json('{"enabled":true,"slug":"transparent-orchid-pot","title":"Transparent Orchid Pot & Seedling Cup Wholesale | GreenSmart","metaDescription":"Transparent orchid pot & seedling cup wholesale from China — clear PET/PP, ø5–15 cm, MOQ 200 pcs. Root-visible design. FOB Shenzhen.","h1":"Transparent Orchid Pot & Seedling Cup","intro":"Crystal-clear walls let light reach orchid roots and let growers monitor root health without repotting. The essential growing container for Southeast Asia''s orchid trade — from Thai exporters to Vietnamese hobby growers.","points":["Crystal-clear PET or PS — roots visible from outside","Side drainage slots promote air circulation to roots","Sizes ø5 cm to ø15 cm covering all orchid pot standards","Also available: seedling cup / propagation cup variants","Stackable sleeve design for compact storage and freight"],"ctaPrimary":"Request Quote","ctaWhatsapp":"WhatsApp Sales","quickSpecs":[["MOQ","From 200 pcs"],["Lead Time","15–25 days"],["FOB Port","Shenzhen / Guangzhou"],["Sample","$5–12, refundable"]],"image":"product-bamboo-fiber.jpg","imageAlt":"Transparent orchid pot seedling cup wholesale","specsTitle":"Product specifications","specs":[["Material","Crystal-clear PET (rigid) or PS; frosted clear PP option"],["Orchid pot sizes","ø5.5 / ø8 / ø10 / ø12 / ø15 cm"],["Seedling cup sizes","50 ml / 100 ml / 200 ml / 350 ml"],["Drainage","Slotted sides + base holes; slot width 2–4 mm"],["Transparency","≥85% light transmission (standard clear grade)"],["Colors","Crystal clear, frosted clear, light green, light pink"],["MOQ","200 pcs per size (orchid); 500 pcs per size (seedling cup)"],["Stacking","Sleeve-stack; 200 ø10 cm pots ≈ 0.3 CBM"],["Certifications","Food-safe PET grade; BPA-free; Form E available"]],"buyerTitle":"Best-fit buyers","buyerTags":["Orchid farms TH/VN","Orchid exporters","Nursery supply wholesalers","Plant propagation shops","Hobby grower retailers","Botanical garden suppliers"],"whyTitle":"Why transparent pots dominate orchid growing","whyItems":[["Root health monitoring","growers see root color and moisture level without disturbing roots — green/silver roots indicate healthy vs dry status."],["Photosynthesis boost","orchid roots contain chlorophyll and benefit from light exposure — clear pots improve root vitality."],["Thailand orchid export","Thailand is the world''s largest orchid exporter; transparent pots are standard for Dendrobium and Phalaenopsis trade packs."]],"galleryTitle":"Size Range & Variants","galleryNote":"Detailed clear-pot photo set available on request — WhatsApp us for a closer look.","gallery":[{"image":"product-bamboo-fiber-2.jpg","caption":"Root visibility · slotted wall detail"},{"image":"product-bamboo-fiber.jpg","caption":"Size range · orchid in bloom"}],"faqTitle":"Common buyer questions","faq":[["PET vs PS?","PET is more rigid and higher clarity; PS is lower cost. For orchid growers, PET is recommended. For seedling cups (single-use), PS is fine."],["Do slots weaken the pot?","No — reinforced slot rim design maintains structural integrity. Tested up to 2 kg plant + growing medium."],["Can we print logos on clear pots?","Yes — screen print or shrink sleeve label. MOQ 500 pcs for screen print."],["Available with outer decorative pot?","Yes — we can supply matched opaque outer cachepot to sit the clear orchid pot inside."]],"shippingTitle":"Freight & export notes","shipping":["Excellent CBM efficiency — sleeve-stacked clear pots have among the lowest freight cost per unit of any pot category.","HS 3926.90 — RCEP rate 0–5% applies for all major SEA markets.","Key export routes: FOB Shenzhen → Don Mueang/Bangkok (air for samples); sea to Cat Lai or Laem Chabang for bulk.","Thai buyers: frequently mixed with root control pots in same LCL for nursery supply packages."],"moqLadder":["200-499 pcs per size: stock moulds, crystal clear standard","500-1999 pcs: mixed sizes and seedling cup combinations","2000+ pcs: custom tint, screen print, or shrink sleeve label"],"leadTime":["Sampling: 5-10 days including clarity check","Bulk order: 15-25 days after deposit confirmation","Peak season buffer: suggest 2 weeks before orchid trade peaks"],"related":["self-watering-double-layer","root-control-gallon-pot","creative-shaped-planter"],"languages":["en","vi","th","id"],"translations":{"vi":{"title":"Chau Lan Trong Suot & Coc Uom Cay Gia Si | GreenSmart","metaDescription":"Chau lan trong suot va coc uom cay gia si tu Trung Quoc — PET/PP trong, ø5-15 cm, MOQ 200 cai. Nhin thay re. Hot tai thi truong lan Thai Lan, Viet Nam. FOB Shenzhen.","h1":"Chau Lan Trong Suot & Coc Uom Cay","intro":"Thanh trong suot cho anh sang den re lan va giup nguoi trong theo doi suc khoe re ma khong can thay chau. Chau trong thiet yeu cua nganh lan Dong Nam A — tu nha xuat khau Thai den nguoi trong Viet Nam.","points":["PET hoac PS trong suot — nhin thay re tu ben ngoai","Khe thoat nuoc ben hong tang luu thong khi den re","Kich thuoc ø5 cm den ø15 cm du chuan chau lan","Co san phien ban coc uom / coc nhan giong","Thiet ke xep long giam kho chua va cuoc van"],"quickSpecs":[["MOQ","Tu 200 cai"],["Thoi gian giao","15-25 ngay"],["Cang FOB","Shenzhen / Guangzhou"],["Hang mau","$5-12, hoan phi"]],"specsTitle":"Thong so san pham","specs":[["Vat lieu","PET trong suot (cung) hoac PS; tuy chon PP mo"],["Size chau lan","ø5,5 / ø8 / ø10 / ø12 / ø15 cm"],["Size coc uom","50 ml / 100 ml / 200 ml / 350 ml"],["Thoat nuoc","Khe ben hong + lo day; khe rong 2-4 mm"],["Do trong","≥85% anh sang xuyen qua (chuan trong tieu chuan)"],["Mau sac","Trong suot, trong mo, xanh nhat, hong nhat"],["MOQ","200 cai moi size (chau lan); 500 cai moi size (coc uom)"],["Xep chong","Xep long; 200 chau ø10 cm ≈ 0,3 CBM"],["Chung nhan","PET chuan thuc pham; khong BPA; co Form E"]],"buyerTitle":"Nguoi mua phu hop nhat","buyerTags":["Trang trai lan TH/VN","Nha xuat khau lan","Ban si vat tu vuon uom","Shop nhan giong cay","Nha ban le nguoi choi lan","Nha cung cap vuon bach thao"],"whyTitle":"Vi sao chau trong suot thong tri nganh lan","whyItems":[["Theo doi suc khoe re","nguoi trong thay mau re va do am ma khong dong den re — re xanh/bac la khoe."],["Tang quang hop","re lan chua diep luc va huong loi tu anh sang — chau trong giup re khoe hon."],["Xuat khau lan Thai","Thai Lan la nuoc xuat khau lan lon nhat the gioi; chau trong la chuan cho Dendrobium va Phalaenopsis."]],"galleryTitle":"Dai kich thuoc va phien ban","galleryNote":"Them anh chau trong se gui qua WhatsApp hoac email sau khi lien he.","faq":[["PET hay PS?","PET cung hon va trong hon; PS re hon. Trong lan nen dung PET. Coc uom (dung mot lan) thi PS du tot."],["Khe co lam yeu chau?","Khong — vien khe gia cuong giu do cung. Da thu nghiem den 2 kg cay + gia the."],["In logo len chau trong duoc khong?","Duoc — in lua hoac nhan co. MOQ 500 cai cho in lua."],["Co chau ngoai trang tri kem khong?","Co — chung toi cung cap chau ngoai duc mau dong bo de dat chau trong ben trong."]],"shipping":["Hieu qua CBM xuat sac — chau trong xep long co cuoc van moi don vi thap nhat trong cac loai chau.","HS 3926.90 — thue RCEP 0-5% ap dung cho cac thi truong Dong Nam A chinh.","Tuyen chinh: FOB Shenzhen → Bangkok (bay cho mau); duong bien den Cat Lai hoac Laem Chabang cho don lon.","Nguoi mua Thai: thuong ghep chung chau kiem soat re trong cung LCL cho goi vat tu vuon uom."],"ctaPrimary":"Yeu cau bao gia","ctaWhatsapp":"WhatsApp ban hang","moqLadder":["200-499 cai moi size: khuon san, trong suot tieu chuan","500-1999 cai: tron size va ket hop coc uom","2000+ cai: nhuom mau, in lua hoac nhan co theo yeu cau"],"leadTime":["Lam mau: 5-10 ngay gom kiem tra do trong","Don lon: 15-25 ngay sau xac nhan dat coc","Mua cao diem: nen dat truoc 2 tuan mua lan cao diem"]},"th":{"title":"กระถางกล้วยไม้ใส & ถ้วยเพาะกล้าราคาส่ง | GreenSmart","metaDescription":"กระถางกล้วยไม้ใสและถ้วยเพาะกล้าราคาส่งจากจีน — PET/PP ใส ø5-15 ซม. MOQ 200 ชิ้น มองเห็นราก มาตรฐานตลาดกล้วยไม้ไทย-เวียดนาม FOB เซินเจิ้น","h1":"กระถางกล้วยไม้ใส & ถ้วยเพาะกล้า","intro":"ผนังใสให้แสงถึงรากกล้วยไม้ และให้ผู้ปลูกดูสุขภาพรากได้โดยไม่ต้องเปลี่ยนกระถาง ภาชนะปลูกหลักของวงการกล้วยไม้อาเซียน — จากผู้ส่งออกไทยถึงนักเลี้ยงเวียดนาม","points":["PET หรือ PS ใสคริสตัล — มองเห็นรากจากภายนอก","ช่องระบายด้านข้างเพิ่มอากาศหมุนเวียนถึงราก","ขนาด ø5 ซม. ถึง ø15 ซม. ครบมาตรฐานกระถางกล้วยไม้","มีรุ่นถ้วยเพาะกล้า / ถ้วยขยายพันธุ์ด้วย","ดีไซน์สวมซ้อนประหยัดพื้นที่เก็บและค่าขนส่ง"],"quickSpecs":[["MOQ","ตั้งแต่ 200 ชิ้น"],["ระยะเวลาผลิต","15-25 วัน"],["ท่าเรือ FOB","เซินเจิ้น / กว่างโจว"],["ตัวอย่าง","$5-12 คืนเงินเมื่อสั่ง"]],"specsTitle":"สเปกสินค้า","specs":[["วัสดุ","PET ใสคริสตัล (แข็ง) หรือ PS; เลือก PP ขุ่นได้"],["ขนาดกระถางกล้วยไม้","ø5.5 / ø8 / ø10 / ø12 / ø15 ซม."],["ขนาดถ้วยเพาะ","50 / 100 / 200 / 350 มล."],["การระบายน้ำ","ช่องข้าง + รูก้น; ช่องกว้าง 2-4 มม."],["ความใส","แสงผ่าน ≥85% (เกรดใสมาตรฐาน)"],["สี","ใสคริสตัล ใสขุ่น เขียวอ่อน ชมพูอ่อน"],["MOQ","200 ชิ้นต่อขนาด (กล้วยไม้); 500 ชิ้นต่อขนาด (ถ้วยเพาะ)"],["การซ้อน","สวมซ้อน; 200 ใบ ø10 ซม. ≈ 0.3 CBM"],["ใบรับรอง","PET เกรดอาหาร; ปลอด BPA; มี Form E"]],"buyerTitle":"ผู้ซื้อที่เหมาะที่สุด","buyerTags":["ฟาร์มกล้วยไม้ TH/VN","ผู้ส่งออกกล้วยไม้","ผู้ค้าส่งวัสดุเพาะชำ","ร้านขยายพันธุ์ไม้","ร้านค้านักเลี้ยงมือสมัครเล่น","ซัพพลายเออร์สวนพฤกษศาสตร์"],"whyTitle":"ทำไมกระถางใสครองวงการกล้วยไม้","whyItems":[["ดูสุขภาพราก","เห็นสีรากและความชื้นโดยไม่ต้องแตะราก — รากเขียว/เงินคือแข็งแรง เทา/นิ่มคือมีปัญหา"],["เสริมการสังเคราะห์แสง","รากกล้วยไม้มีคลอโรฟิลล์และได้ประโยชน์จากแสง — กระถางใสช่วยให้รากแข็งแรงขึ้น"],["ส่งออกกล้วยไม้ไทย","ไทยคือผู้ส่งออกกล้วยไม้อันดับหนึ่งของโลก; กระถางใสคือมาตรฐานแพ็กหวายและฟาแลนนอปซิส"]],"galleryTitle":"ช่วงขนาดและแบบ","galleryNote":"รูปกระถางใสเพิ่มเติมส่งทาง WhatsApp หรืออีเมลหลังสอบถาม","faq":[["PET หรือ PS?","PET แข็งกว่าและใสกว่า; PS ถูกกว่า สำหรับผู้เลี้ยงกล้วยไม้แนะนำ PET ถ้วยเพาะ (ใช้ครั้งเดียว) PS ก็เพียงพอ"],["ช่องทำให้กระถางอ่อนแอไหม?","ไม่ — ขอบช่องเสริมแรงคงความแข็ง ทดสอบถึง 2 กก. ต้นไม้ + เครื่องปลูก"],["พิมพ์โลโก้บนกระถางใสได้ไหม?","ได้ — สกรีนหรือฉลากชริงค์ MOQ 500 ชิ้นสำหรับสกรีน"],["มีกระถางนอกตกแต่งไหม?","มี — เราจัดกระถางนอกทึบสีเข้าชุดสำหรับสวมกระถางใสด้านใน"]],"shipping":["CBM คุ้มมาก — กระถางใสสวมซ้อนมีค่าขนส่งต่อชิ้นต่ำสุดในบรรดากระถางทุกหมวด","HS 3926.90 — สิทธิ์ RCEP 0-5% ใช้ได้กับตลาดอาเซียนหลักทั้งหมด","เส้นทางหลัก: FOB เซินเจิ้น → กรุงเทพ (แอร์สำหรับตัวอย่าง); ทางเรือไป Cat Lai หรือแหลมฉบังสำหรับล็อตใหญ่","ผู้ซื้อไทย: มักรวม LCL กับกระถางควบคุมรากเป็นแพ็กเกจวัสดุเพาะชำ"],"ctaPrimary":"ขอใบเสนอราคา","ctaWhatsapp":"WhatsApp ฝ่ายขาย","moqLadder":["200-499 ชิ้นต่อขนาด: แม่พิมพ์สต็อก ใสมาตรฐาน","500-1999 ชิ้น: คละขนาดและจับคู่ถ้วยเพาะได้","2000+ ชิ้น: สีพิเศษ สกรีน หรือฉลากชริงค์"],"leadTime":["ตัวอย่าง: 5-10 วันรวมตรวจความใส","ล็อตใหญ่: 15-25 วันหลังยืนยันมัดจำ","ช่วงพีค: แนะนำจองก่อน 2 สัปดาห์ก่อนพีคกล้วยไม้"]},"id":{"title":"Pot Anggrek Transparan & Cup Semai Grosir | GreenSmart","metaDescription":"Pot anggrek transparan dan cup semai grosir dari China — PET/PP bening, ø5-15 cm, MOQ 200 pcs. Akar terlihat. Tren di pasar anggrek Thailand, Vietnam. FOB Shenzhen.","h1":"Pot Anggrek Transparan & Cup Semai","intro":"Dinding bening meneruskan cahaya ke akar anggrek dan memudahkan pemantauan kesehatan akar tanpa repotting. Wadah tanam esensial perdagangan anggrek Asia Tenggara — dari eksportir Thailand sampai hobiis Vietnam.","points":["PET atau PS bening kristal — akar terlihat dari luar","Celah drainase samping tingkatkan sirkulasi udara ke akar","Ukuran ø5 cm sampai ø15 cm lengkap standar pot anggrek","Tersedia juga varian cup semai / cup propagasi","Desain susun-sarung hemat penyimpanan dan freight"],"quickSpecs":[["MOQ","Mulai 200 pcs"],["Lead Time","15-25 hari"],["Pelabuhan FOB","Shenzhen / Guangzhou"],["Sampel","$5-12, dikembalikan saat order"]],"specsTitle":"Spesifikasi produk","specs":[["Material","PET bening kristal (kaku) atau PS; opsi PP frosted"],["Ukuran pot anggrek","ø5,5 / ø8 / ø10 / ø12 / ø15 cm"],["Ukuran cup semai","50 ml / 100 ml / 200 ml / 350 ml"],["Drainase","Celah samping + lubang dasar; lebar celah 2-4 mm"],["Transparansi","Transmisi cahaya ≥85% (grade bening standar)"],["Warna","Bening kristal, bening frosted, hijau muda, pink muda"],["MOQ","200 pcs per ukuran (anggrek); 500 pcs per ukuran (cup semai)"],["Penyusunan","Susun-sarung; 200 pot ø10 cm ≈ 0,3 CBM"],["Sertifikasi","PET food-grade; bebas BPA; Form E tersedia"]],"buyerTitle":"Pembeli paling cocok","buyerTags":["Kebun anggrek TH/VN","Eksportir anggrek","Grosir vasilitas pembibitan","Toko propagasi tanaman","Retailer penghobi","Supplier kebun raya"],"whyTitle":"Mengapa pot transparan menguasai budidaya anggrek","whyItems":[["Pantau kesehatan akar","penanam melihat warna akar dan kelembapan tanpa mengganggu akar — akar hijau/perak berarti sehat."],["Dorongan fotosintesis","akar anggrek mengandung klorofil dan diuntungkan paparan cahaya — pot bening tingkatkan vitalitas akar."],["Ekspor anggrek Thailand","Thailand eksportir anggrek terbesar dunia; pot transparan adalah standar paket Dendrobium dan Phalaenopsis."]],"galleryTitle":"Rentang ukuran dan varian","galleryNote":"Foto pot bening lainnya dikirim via WhatsApp atau email setelah inquiry.","faq":[["PET atau PS?","PET lebih kaku dan lebih bening; PS lebih murah. Untuk penanam anggrek, PET direkomendasikan. Untuk cup semai (sekali pakai), PS cukup."],["Apakah celah melemahkan pot?","Tidak — desain bibir celah diperkuat menjaga integritas struktur. Teruji sampai 2 kg tanaman + media tanam."],["Bisa cetak logo di pot bening?","Bisa — sablon atau label shrink sleeve. MOQ 500 pcs untuk sablon."],["Ada pot luar dekoratif?","Ada — kami suplai cachepot luar opaque serasi untuk menaruh pot bening di dalamnya."]],"shipping":["Efisiensi CBM sangat baik — pot bening susun-sarung punya biaya freight per unit terendah di semua kategori pot.","HS 3926.90 — tarif RCEP 0-5% berlaku untuk semua pasar utama Asia Tenggara.","Rute utama: FOB Shenzhen → Bangkok (udara untuk sampel); laut ke Cat Lai atau Laem Chabang untuk order besar.","Pembeli Thailand: sering digabung pot kontrol akar dalam LCL sama untuk paket vasilitas pembibitan."],"ctaPrimary":"Minta Penawaran","ctaWhatsapp":"WhatsApp Sales","moqLadder":["200-499 pcs per ukuran: cetakan stok, bening standar","500-1999 pcs: campur ukuran dan kombinasi cup semai","2000+ pcs: tint kustom, sablon, atau label shrink sleeve"],"leadTime":["Sampel: 5-10 hari termasuk cek kejernihan","Order besar: 15-25 hari setelah konfirmasi DP","Musim puncak: sarankan 2 minggu sebelum puncak perdagangan anggrek"]}}}')), updated_at = '2026-10-28T08:33:28.324Z' WHERE id = 'prod_gs_orchid_001';

UPDATE products SET spec_json = json_set(spec_json, '$.detail', json('{"enabled":true,"slug":"creative-shaped-planter","title":"Creative Shaped Planter Wholesale | GreenSmart","metaDescription":"Creative shaped planter wholesale from China — animal, faux stone, dinosaur egg designs. MOQ 50 pcs, resin/MGO, OEM. Gift-ready for Shopee & TikTok.","h1":"Creative & Novelty Shaped Planters","intro":"High-margin gift and home-décor planters with viral appeal on Shopee, Lazada, and TikTok Shop across Southeast Asia. Animal shapes, expressive faces, faux-stone textures, and dinosaur egg designs — new collections every season.","points":["Animal series: cat, rabbit, bear, hedgehog, cactus face","Expression faces: happy, grumpy, surprised, shy","Faux stone & concrete texture finish","Dinosaur egg & novelty seasonal designs","Gift-box packaging, hang tags, OEM logo available"],"ctaPrimary":"Request Catalogue","ctaWhatsapp":"WhatsApp for Latest Designs","quickSpecs":[["MOQ","From 50 pcs/design"],["Lead Time","20–35 days"],["FOB Port","Shenzhen / Yiwu"],["Sample","$8–25, refundable"]],"image":"product-terracotta.jpg","imageAlt":"Creative shaped novelty planters wholesale","specsTitle":"Design series & specifications","specs":[["Animal series","Cat · Rabbit · Bear · Hedgehog · Corgi · Cactus-face"],["Expression series","Happy face · Grumpy · Surprised · Winking · Shy blush"],["Texture series","Faux stone · Faux concrete · Faux terracotta · Marble print"],["Novelty series","Dinosaur egg · Acorn · Mushroom cap · Mini log stump"],["Material","Resin (lightweight), MGO cement composite, or poly-resin"],["Sizes","Small: 8–12 cm · Medium: 13–18 cm · Large: 19–25 cm"],["MOQ","50 pcs per design (mixed designs in same order accepted)"],["Packaging","Individual gift box, bubble wrap, OEM insert card"],["Price range (FOB)","USD 1.80–6.50 per piece depending on size and design"]],"designBadges":["🐱 Cat pot","🐰 Rabbit pot","🐻 Bear pot","😊 Happy face","😤 Grumpy face","🪨 Faux stone","🥚 Dino egg","🍄 Mushroom"],"buyerTitle":"Best-fit buyers","buyerTags":["Gift shops SEA","TikTok / IG sellers","Home decor boutiques","Florists & flower shops","Department store gifting","Subscription box curators"],"whyTitle":"Why these sell on SEA platforms","whyItems":[["Viral content","animal and expression pots generate organic UGC on TikTok and Instagram — buyers report 3–5× higher share rates vs standard planters."],["Gift season peaks","Valentine''s Day, Songkran, Hari Raya, Tết — novelty planters outsell standard pots 4:1 in gift-occasion weeks on Shopee."],["High margin","landed cost USD 2–4, retail price THB 250–450 / VND 80,000–150,000 / SGD 12–22."],["Low MOQ per design","buyers can stock 6–8 designs at 50 pcs each rather than committing to one design."]],"galleryTitle":"Design Series Gallery","galleryNote":"Browse our full catalogue of 50+ mould designs — request the PDF catalogue on WhatsApp, with new collections added quarterly.","gallery":[{"image":"product-terracotta-2.jpg","caption":"Relief design · close-up detail"},{"image":"product-terracotta.jpg","caption":"Styled lifestyle · gift-ready look"}],"faqTitle":"Common buyer questions","faq":[["Can we get exclusive designs?","Yes — OEM exclusive mold available from MOQ 500 pcs/design. Mold fee quoted separately."],["Are these waterproof?","Resin and MGO are water-resistant. All designs have drainage hole standard. Not suitable for prolonged outdoor flooding."],["How do you prevent breakage in shipping?","Individual gift boxes + foam insert + outer carton bubble-wrap layer. Breakage rate <1% in standard shipping."],["Seasonal new designs?","We release 10–15 new designs per quarter. WhatsApp subscribers receive first-look catalogue."]],"shippingTitle":"Freight & export notes","shipping":["Resin designs: lightweight (150–400 g each) — air freight viable for small trial orders.","MGO cement designs: heavier — recommend sea freight FCL for orders over 500 pcs.","HS 6913.90 (ceramic-look) or 3926.90 (resin) — verify with your customs broker per specific design.","FOB Yiwu or FOB Shenzhen depending on factory allocation — quote specifies which port."],"moqLadder":["50-199 pcs per design: mixed designs in same order accepted","200-499 pcs: gift-box packaging and OEM insert card","500+ pcs per design: exclusive OEM mould program available"],"leadTime":["Sampling: 7-10 days for catalogue designs","Bulk order: 20-35 days after deposit and packaging approval","Peak season buffer: book 3-4 weeks before gift seasons"],"related":["self-watering-double-layer","root-control-gallon-pot","transparent-orchid-pot"],"languages":["en","vi","th","id"],"translations":{"vi":{"title":"Chau Tao Hinh Sang Tao Gia Si — Hinh Thu, Da Gia, Trung Khung Long | GreenSmart","metaDescription":"Chau tao hinh sang tao gia si tu Trung Quoc — hinh thu, mat bieu cam, da gia, trung khung long. MOQ 50 cai moi mau, resin/MGO, OEM. Hot tren Shopee & TikTok.","h1":"Chau Tao Hinh Sang Tao & Doc La","intro":"Chau qua tang va trang tri bien loi nhuan cao, de viral tren Shopee, Lazada va TikTok Shop khap Dong Nam A. Hinh thu, mat bieu cam, van da gia va trung khung long — bo suu tap moi moi mua.","points":["Dong hinh thu: meo, tho, gau, nhim, mat xuong rong","Dong bieu cam: vui, cau, ngac nhien, then thung","Hoan thien van da gia & be tong gia","Trung khung long & thiet ke doc la theo mua","Hop qua, the treo, logo OEM co san"],"quickSpecs":[["MOQ","Tu 50 cai/mau"],["Thoi gian giao","20-35 ngay"],["Cang FOB","Shenzhen / Yiwu"],["Hang mau","$8-25, hoan phi"]],"specsTitle":"Cac dong thiet ke va thong so","specs":[["Dong hinh thu","Meo · Tho · Gau · Nhim · Corgi · Mat xuong rong"],["Dong bieu cam","Mat vui · Cau kinh · Ngac nhien · Nhay mat · Then thung"],["Dong van da","Da gia · Be tong gia · Dat nung gia · Van cam thach"],["Dong doc la","Trung khung long · Hat de · Nam · Goc cay mini"],["Vat lieu","Resin (nhe), MGO xi mang composite, hoac poly-resin"],["Kich thuoc","Nho: 8-12 cm · Vua: 13-18 cm · Lon: 19-25 cm"],["MOQ","50 cai moi mau (chap nhan tron mau trong mot don)"],["Bao bi","Hop qua rieng, boc bong khi, the OEM"],["Gia FOB","USD 1,80-6,50 moi cai tuy size va thiet ke"]],"buyerTitle":"Nguoi mua phu hop nhat","buyerTags":["Shop qua tang DNA","Nguoi ban TikTok / IG","Boutique trang tri nha","Tiem hoa","Qua tang trung tam thuong mai","Nguoi chon hop qua dinh ky"],"whyTitle":"Vi sao ban chay tren cac san Dong Nam A","whyItems":[["Noi dung viral","chau hinh thu va bieu cam tao UGC tu nhien tren TikTok va Instagram — ty le chia se cao gap 3-5 lan chau thuong."],["Cao diem mua qua","Valentine, Songkran, Hari Raya, Tet — chau doc la ban gap 4 lan chau thuong trong tuan le qua tang tren Shopee."],["Bien loi nhuan cao","gia von USD 2-4, gia ban le THB 250-450 / VND 80.000-150.000 / SGD 12-22."],["MOQ thap moi mau","nguoi mua co the nhap 6-8 mau, moi mau 50 cai thay vi don cuoc vao mot mau."]],"galleryTitle":"Bo suu tap thiet ke","galleryNote":"Catalogue day du (50+ mau) gui qua WhatsApp hoac email sau khi lien he. Bo suu tap moi ra hang quy.","faq":[["Lam mau doc quyen duoc khong?","Duoc — khuon OEM doc quyen tu MOQ 500 cai/mau. Phi khuon bao rieng."],["Co chong nuoc khong?","Resin va MGO chiu nuoc. Moi mau deu co lo thoat nuoc tieu chuan. Khong phu hop ngap nuoc ngoai troi keo dai."],["Chong vo khi van chuyen the nao?","Hop qua rieng + xop lot + lop bong khi thung ngoai. Ty le vo duoi 1% van chuyen tieu chuan."],["Co mau moi theo mua?","Chung toi ra 10-15 mau moi moi quy. Khach WhatsApp nhan catalogue som nhat."]],"shipping":["Mau resin: nhe (150-400 g moi cai) — bay duoc cho don thu nghiem nho.","Mau MGO xi mang: nang hon — nen di bien FCL cho don tren 500 cai.","HS 6913.90 (gia gom) hoac 3926.90 (resin) — xac nhan voi khai quan theo tung mau.","FOB Yiwu hoac FOB Shenzhen tuy phan bo nha may — bao gia ghi ro cang."],"ctaPrimary":"Yeu cau catalogue","ctaWhatsapp":"WhatsApp xem mau moi","moqLadder":["50-199 cai moi mau: chap nhan tron mau trong mot don","200-499 cai: bao bi hop qua va the OEM","500+ cai moi mau: chuong trinh khuon OEM doc quyen"],"leadTime":["Lam mau: 7-10 ngay cho mau trong catalogue","Don lon: 20-35 ngay sau dat coc va duyet bao bi","Mua cao diem: dat truoc 3-4 tuan truoc mua qua tang"]},"th":{"title":"กระถางทรงสร้างสรรค์ราคาส่ง — รูปสัตว์ หินเทียม ไข่ไดโนเสาร์ | GreenSmart","metaDescription":"กระถางทรงสร้างสรรค์ราคาส่งจากจีน — รูปสัตว์ หน้าอารมณ์ หินเทียม ไข่ไดโนเสาร์ MOQ 50 ชิ้นต่อแบบ เรซิน/MGO OEM มาแรงบน Shopee & TikTok","h1":"กระถางทรงสร้างสรรค์ & ดีไซน์แปลกใหม่","intro":"กระถางของขวัญและแต่งบ้านมาร์จิ้นสูง มีพลังไวรัลบน Shopee, Lazada และ TikTok Shop ทั่วอาเซียน รูปสัตว์ หน้าอารมณ์ ผิวหินเทียม และไข่ไดโนเสาร์ — คอลเลกชันใหม่ทุกซีซัน","points":["ซีรีส์สัตว์: แมว กระต่าย หมี เม่น หน้าแคคตัส","ซีรีส์อารมณ์: ยิ้ม หงุดหงิด ตกใจ เขินอาย","ผิวสัมผัสหินเทียม & คอนกรีตเทียม","ไข่ไดโนเสาร์ & ดีไซน์พิเศษตามฤดูกาล","กล่องของขวัญ ป้ายแขวน โลโก้ OEM พร้อม"],"quickSpecs":[["MOQ","ตั้งแต่ 50 ชิ้น/แบบ"],["ระยะเวลาผลิต","20-35 วัน"],["ท่าเรือ FOB","เซินเจิ้น / อี้อู"],["ตัวอย่าง","$8-25 คืนเงินเมื่อสั่ง"]],"specsTitle":"ซีรีส์ดีไซน์และสเปก","specs":[["ซีรีส์สัตว์","แมว · กระต่าย · หมี · เม่น · คอร์กี้ · หน้าแคคตัส"],["ซีรีส์อารมณ์","หน้ายิ้ม · หงุดหงิด · ตกใจ · ขยิบตา · เขินแก้มแดง"],["ซีรีส์ผิวสัมผัส","หินเทียม · คอนกรีตเทียม · ดินเผาเทียม · ลายหินอ่อน"],["ซีรีส์พิเศษ","ไข่ไดโนเสาร์ · ลูกโอ๊ก · เห็ด · ตอไม้มินิ"],["วัสดุ","เรซิน (เบา), MGO ซีเมนต์คอมโพสิต หรือโพลีเรซิน"],["ขนาด","เล็ก: 8-12 ซม. · กลาง: 13-18 ซม. · ใหญ่: 19-25 ซม."],["MOQ","50 ชิ้นต่อแบบ (คละแบบในออเดอร์เดียวได้)"],["บรรจุภัณฑ์","กล่องของขวัญแยกชิ้น บับเบิล การ์ด OEM"],["ช่วงราคา (FOB)","USD 1.80-6.50 ต่อชิ้นตามขนาดและดีไซน์"]],"buyerTitle":"ผู้ซื้อที่เหมาะที่สุด","buyerTags":["ร้านของขวัญอาเซียน","ผู้ขาย TikTok / IG","บูติกแต่งบ้าน","ร้านดอกไม้","ของขวัญห้างสรรพสินค้า","ผู้จัดกล่องสมาชิก"],"whyTitle":"ทำไมขายดีบนแพลตฟอร์มอาเซียน","whyItems":[["คอนเทนต์ไวรัล","กระถางสัตว์และหน้าอารมณ์สร้าง UGC เองบน TikTok และ Instagram — แชร์สูงกว่ากระถางธรรมดา 3-5 เท่า"],["พีคของขวัญ","วาเลนไทน